window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-f5fc356472981cd1"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"build-an-exam-study-system\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">构建备考学习系统</h1> <p>将课程材料转化为可重复使用的计划和练习集。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT，根据学习目标、笔记、阅读材料、习题、往年测验、考试说明和可用时间，创建学习指南、概念图、练习日程、题库和进度跟踪表。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>根据多份课程官方材料备考的学生。</li> <li>需要间隔练习而非一次性总结的学习计划。</li> <li>练习题覆盖范围必须以课程材料为依据的情况。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>创建学习指南、概念图和带来源链接的练习材料。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>制作学习日程和进度跟踪表。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>构建我的备考学习系统</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">根据课程官方学习目标、讲义、阅读材料、习题、往年测验、考试说明和我的可用学习时间，为 [course and exam]（课程与考试名称）制定一套为期两周的学习系统。\n\n请创建：\n\n- 一张概念图\n- 一份简明学习指南\n- 一份间隔练习日历\n- 一个题库\n- 答案解析\n- 一份进度跟踪表\n\n对重要概念标注课程来源，不要臆测考试范围。将不确定或缺少依据的部分标出，供我确认。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"define-the-exam-scope\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">确定考试范围</h2> <p>从官方学习目标、教师说明、讲义、阅读材料、习题和往年测验开始。补充你有多少时间，以及哪些主题是你已经知道需要加强的。</p> <p>请 ChatGPT 将每个计划学习的主题对应到一份课程来源。如果覆盖范围不清楚，就把它保留为待确认的问题，不要把它当作考试内容。</p> <p><a id=\"create-several-study-modes\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">创建几种学习方式</h2> <p>使用起步提示词生成彼此配合的学习材料：</p> <ol> <li>展示知识点之间关系的概念图。</li> <li>简明的复习指南。</li> <li>间隔练习日历。</li> <li>覆盖回忆、解释和应用的题库。</li> <li>与课程来源对应的答案解析。</li> <li>记录知识点掌握情况和练习结果的进度跟踪表。</li> </ol> <p>混合使用不同形式，比反复重读同一份总结更容易发现知识缺口。</p> <p><a id=\"review-and-adapt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">审查并调整</h2> <p>根据官方材料核对题目和解析。删除凭空编造的主题、含糊不清的标准答案和缺乏依据的说法。</p> <p>每次学习后更新跟踪表，并请 ChatGPT 根据观察到的薄弱点调整后续学习安排。遵守教师规定，妥善保管评分测验和任何受限课程材料。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"build-an-exam-study-system\">Build an exam study system</h1> <p>Turn course materials into a reusable plan and practice set.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT with learning objectives, notes, readings, problem sets, prior quizzes, exam guidance, and available time to create a study guide, concept map, practice schedule, question bank, and progress tracker.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Students preparing for an exam from several official course sources.</li> <li>Study plans that need spaced practice rather than a one-time summary.</li> <li>Practice questions whose coverage must stay grounded in course materials.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Create the study guide, concept map, and source-linked practice materials.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Build a study schedule and progress tracker.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Build My Exam Study System</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Build a two-week study system for [course and exam] using the official learning objectives, lecture notes, readings, problem sets, prior quizzes, and my available study time.\n\nCreate:\n- a concept map\n- a concise study guide\n- a spaced-practice calendar\n- a question bank\n- answer explanations\n- a progress tracker\n\nCite the course source for major concepts and do not invent exam coverage. Mark uncertain or missing coverage for me to confirm.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"define-the-exam-scope\">Define the exam scope</h2> <p>Start with official learning objectives, instructor guidance, lecture notes, readings, problem sets, and prior quizzes. Add the time you have available and any topics you already know need work.</p> <p>Ask ChatGPT to map each planned topic to a course source. If coverage is unclear, keep it as a question instead of treating it as exam content.</p> <h2 id=\"create-several-study-modes\">Create several study modes</h2> <p>Use the starter prompt to produce complementary artifacts:</p> <ol> <li>A concept map that shows relationships.</li> <li>A concise guide for review.</li> <li>A spaced-practice calendar.</li> <li>A question bank across recall, explanation, and application.</li> <li>Answer explanations tied to course sources.</li> <li>A progress tracker for topics and practice results.</li> </ol> <p>Mixing formats makes it easier to identify gaps than repeatedly rereading one summary.</p> <h2 id=\"review-and-adapt\">Review and adapt</h2> <p>Check questions and explanations against the official materials. Remove invented topics, ambiguous answer keys, and unsupported claims.</p> <p>After each study session, update the tracker and ask ChatGPT to revise the next sessions around observed gaps. Keep graded assessments and any restricted course material within the rules set by the instructor.</p>"};
